               alt: 'Illustration of two capillary beds: the left fine and evenly branched, the right denser, wider and more tortuous.' }}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <figcaption>
        <span class="fig-tag">Fig. 3</span>
        <span>The dermal vessel bed of a single subject, at 28 and at 42. Only the circulatory architecture has changed. <em>Demirbas et al., J Cosmet Dermatol, 2025.</em></span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="pullquote">
      <p>A flush is not the event of a minute. It is a deposit into an account that compounds.</p>
    </div>

